-- Record types, sheets, templates, experiments, aliases and label templates in
-- the shared pipeline registries (docs/development/features.md): the events a
-- pipeline may start on, the actions a pipeline step may run, and the one
-- delete agents may do behind a confirmation. Each definition is the action
-- as the app lists it (PIPELINE_ACTIONS), so the two agree.

ON CONFLICT (name) DO NOTHING;
--> statement-breakpoint

ON CONFLICT (operation) DO UPDATE SET definition = EXCLUDED.definition;
--> statement-breakpoint

-- A draft experiment that was never submitted; only its author or an admin.
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
